  localContent: "Marcus Ghiasi is a Licensed Marriage and Family Therapist offering telehealth therapy to Concord adults and Contra Costa residents. Concord's population reflects a wide range of economic backgrounds, occupations, and life circumstances -- working-class and middle-class families navigating Bay Area cost of living, veterans and first responders carrying occupational stress, men who have been managing silently for longer than they should have, adults dealing with anger that is creating real problems in their relationships or employment. The approach here takes all of it seriously without requiring that it be framed in clinical language first. Sessions are Wednesday through Friday from anywhere in California. IFS maps and works directly with the internal parts driving anxiety, anger, avoidance, and relationship patterns. EMDR processes the experiences stored in the nervous system that continue to organize current reactions regardless of insight or time. A free 15-minute consultation is the starting point.",
