    "Beyond the immigration-specific concerns, Sunnyvale adults navigate the same pressures as the broader Silicon Valley population -- work anxiety, relationship strain from demanding careers, burnout, and the difficulty of genuine connection in a city where most social life is organized around professional identity. Individual therapy for adults 18 and older, with a genuine understanding of the cultural complexity that shapes how these concerns are experienced and what approaches actually fit.",
