    "IFS sessions are structured and focused. Each session works with specific parts of the internal system -- getting curious about them, understanding what they are protecting, and building a more functional relationship with the whole. The work is not about producing insight for its own sake. It is about producing change in how you relate to yourself and the people around you. EMDR sessions process specific experiences that the nervous system has not fully resolved.",
