  localContent: "Marcus Ghiasi is a Licensed Marriage and Family Therapist offering telehealth therapy to South San Francisco adults and San Mateo County residents. Sessions are Wednesday through Friday from anywhere in California. IFS is the primary framework -- working with the internal parts that drive anxiety, perfectionism, overwork, and the relationship patterns that keep recurring despite genuine effort to change them. EMDR addresses trauma and the experiences stored in the nervous system that continue to affect current functioning regardless of how much time has passed. A free 15-minute consultation is the starting point with no commitment required.",
