  localContent: "Marcus Ghiasi is a Licensed Marriage and Family Therapist offering men's therapy to Palo Alto adults and Peninsula men via telehealth. Palo Alto's achievement culture means most men who seek therapy here have been managing the difficulty for longer than they should have -- and have often tried previous approaches that produced insight without producing change. The work here draws on IFS to engage the internal parts most active in Palo Alto men's presentations directly, and EMDR to process the specific experiences that established the patterns underlying perfectionism, anxiety, and contingent self-worth. Sessions are Wednesday through Friday from anywhere in California. A free 15-minute consultation is the starting point.",
